  <!-- ═══ FRE Welcome Page ═══ -->
  <data name="FreOverlay_WelcomeTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Selamat datang di Terminal Cerdas</value>
    <comment>{Locked=qps-ploc,qps-ploca,qps-plocm} "Intelligent Terminal" is the product name.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_WelcomeSubtitlePrefix" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Siapkan asisten bawaan Anda untuk membantu menjelaskan kesalahan, menyusun perintah, dan mengatasi tugas yang terhambat langsung di tempat Anda bekerja. </value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_WelcomeSubtitleLink" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pelajari selengkapnya tentang Terminal Cerdas</value>
    <comment>{Locked=qps-ploc,qps-ploca,qps-plocm} "Intelligent Terminal" is the product name.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_Card1Title.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tetap produktif dengan agen AI bawaan</value>
    <comment>In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_Card1Description.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Agen Anda selalu mengetahui apa yang terjadi di terminal Anda dan dapat membantu Anda memahami serta memperbaiki kesalahan saat muncul.</value>
    <comment>In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_Card2Title.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Lanjutkan tepat dari tempat Anda berhenti</value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_Card2Description.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Lacak sesi agen yang aktif dan sebelumnya, lalu kembali ke pekerjaan Anda dalam hitungan detik. Tinjau apa yang sedang berlangsung atau kunjungi kembali pekerjaan sebelumnya tanpa kehilangan posisi Anda.</value>
    <comment>In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_NextButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Berikutnya</value>
  </data>
  <!-- ═══ FRE Settings Page ═══ -->
  <data name="FreOverlay_SettingsTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Selamat datang di Terminal Cerdas</value>
    <comment>{Locked=qps-ploc,qps-ploca,qps-plocm} "Intelligent Terminal" is the product name.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SettingsSubtitlePrefix" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pilih apa yang ingin Anda atur sekarang. Anda dapat mengubahnya kapan saja. </value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SettingsSubtitleLink" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pelajari cara penggunaan data</value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_AgentLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Agen</value>
    <comment>In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_AgentDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pilih agen untuk panel agen Anda. Pelajari selengkapnya tentang ACP.</value>
    <comment>{Locked="ACP"} Here "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a proxy, human agent, or representative. ACP is displayed as a hyperlink.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_AgentInstallHint.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Menginstal runtime Node.js jika belum ada di komputer Anda.</value>
    <comment>{Locked="Node.js"} This hint appears when selecting an AI agent whose Node.js runtime may need to be installed automatically.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SessionLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Manajemen sesi</value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SessionDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Lacak sesi agen Anda yang sedang berjalan dan sebelumnya.</value>
    <comment>Description for session tracking in the first-run wizard. In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SessionHint.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Mengaktifkan ini akan menginstal hooks integrasi untuk melacak sesi di seluruh agen Anda.</value>
    <comment>{Locked="hooks"} In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_ShowTokenUsageAndCostLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Tampilkan penggunaan konteks dan biaya sesi</value><comment>Header for a first-run toggle that shows available context-window usage and session cost in the terminal bottom bar. Session cost is reported for the active AI session. Keep 'session cost' generic and do not add a specific unit. Either value may be unavailable.</comment></data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_ShowTokenUsageAndCostDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Jika tersedia, tampilkan penggunaan jendela konteks dan biaya sesi di bilah bawah terminal.</value><comment>Description for the usage visibility toggle in the first-run wizard. Session cost is reported for the active AI session. Keep 'session cost' generic and do not add a specific unit. Either value may be unavailable.</comment></data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_PanePositionLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Posisi panel</value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_PanePositionDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Posisi panel agen terbuka relatif terhadap terminal Anda.</value>
    <comment>In this context, "agent" refers to an AI agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a human agent or representative.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="FreOverlay_SaveButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Simpan</value>
  </data>
